<title>UK: Housing New Zealand sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Housing New Zealand sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSING NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   20.JUN.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 S&amp;P	  A+</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
